"""
Generated by Stinger-IPC code generator {{generator.version}}.

Integration test client for the {{stinger.name}} interface.

Unlike client_demo.py, this is not meant to run forever or be watched by a
human: it discovers the server, exercises every signal/method/command/
property exactly once, prints one ``[CHECK] <name> ... PASS|FAIL`` line per
check, then a final ``RESULT: PASS|FAIL (n/m checks)`` line and exits -
0 if every check passed, 1 otherwise. Every wait below has a timeout, so a
broker or server that never shows up fails the run instead of hanging it.

Run server_integration_test.py first (same MQTT_HOSTNAME/MQTT_PORT), then run
this.
"""
